    <div class="halacha-source">Based on <em>Likutay Tinyana</em> (Second Part), discourse 4:3 — <em>"Tik'u"</em> (Sound the Shofar) — see <em>Hilchos Maachalai Akum</em> (Laws of Food of a Non-Jew), Halacha 2</div>
